legend left
  <b>HomeBandhu — UML Class Diagram Legend</b>
  == Visibility ==
  + public   - private   # protected   {static} class-scope
  == Relationships ==
  ──▷ generalization    ┈┈▷ realization
  ◆── composition       ◇── aggregation
  ──  association       ┈┈> dependency
  ( , ) .. X  association class X
  == Multiplicity ==
  1   0..1   0..*   1..*
  == Property strings ==
  {PK} {unique} {required} {readOnly}   /derived
  == Stereotypes ==
  «aggregate root» «entity» «value object» «enumeration»
  «association class» «event» «external system» «immutable»
  == Types ==
  DateTime≡timestamptz · Money≡numeric(12,2) · JSON≡jsonb · ids UUID
  == Subdomain colours ==
  navy=Identity  teal=Occupancy  gold=Staff  red=WorkOrders
  purple=Visitors  green=Amenities/Finance  blue=Comms/Audit
  dashed border box = external system
  == Multi-tenancy ==
  Every TenantScopedEntity carries communityId; Postgres RLS +
  auth.uid()/membership predicates isolate & authorize each row.
endlegend

